# Dashy requires no secrets of its own — it ships with no built-in auth enabled.
# Access is controlled by the Traefik basic-auth gate declared in metadata.yaml
# (basic_auth: true) — the customer's server password is applied there, not here.
#
# Dashy reads its dashboard configuration from the mounted volume at
# /app/user-data/conf.yml. If that file is absent on first start, Dashy uses its
# built-in demo configuration, which the customer can edit via the UI and save back
# to the volume. No env-var configuration is required.
